## 3. Payloads standards par workflow

### Chatbot (`/api/chat`)

**Next.js → n8n :**
```json
{
  "message": "string",
  "history": [{ "role": "user|assistant", "content": "string" }],
  "sessionId": "string (optionnel)"
}
```

**n8n → Next.js :**
```json
{ "response": "string" }
```
Fallback : lire `data.response ?? data.output ?? data.text` (n8n peut renvoyer différents champs selon le nœud).

### Reçu PDF (`N8N_RECEIPT_WEBHOOK_URL`)

**Next.js → n8n :**
```json
{ "token": "order-token-uuid" }
```

n8n génère le PDF, puis **rappelle** Next.js via `POST /api/orders/[token]/receipt-pdf` (voir Section 5).

### Confirmation réservation (`N8N_BOOKING_CONFIRM_WEBHOOK_URL`)

**Next.js → n8n :**
```json
{
  "bookingId": "uuid",
  "guestEmail": "string",
  "guestName": "string",
  "villaName": "string",
  "startDate": "ISO8601",
  "endDate": "ISO8601",
  "totalPrice": 0
}
```

n8n envoie l'email de confirmation via Resend/SMTP.

### Notification admin (`N8N_NOTIFY_ADMIN_WEBHOOK_URL`)

**Next.js → n8n :**
```json
{
  "type": "new_booking | new_order | new_lead",
  "bookingId": "uuid (si booking)",
  "orderId": "uuid (si order)",
  "guestName": "string",
  "summary": "string (court résumé pour notif Telegram/WhatsApp)"
}
```

